                    <div class="absolute left-5 -top-2 w-2 h-2 bg-red-500"></div>

                </div>


                <div
                    id="script"
                    class="absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 px-[12%] py-20 transition-transform duration-75">

                    <div class="teleprompter-text text-white/90 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto">

                        <p class="font-bold mb-10">
                            Government announces new development project
                        </p>

                        <p class="mb-8">
                            The government has announced a new development
                            project aimed at improving public services across
                            the country.
                        </p>

                        <p class="mb-8">
                            Officials said the project will focus on upgrading
                            existing facilities and introducing new services
                            for communities.
                        </p>

                        <p class="mb-8">
                            The announcement was made during a press conference
                            held in Malé today.
                        </p>

                        <p class="mb-8">
                            Authorities said further details about the project
                            will be released in the coming weeks.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            The government expects the first phase of the project
                            to begin later this year.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- Playback controls -->
            <div class="h-[86px] shrink-0 border-t border-white/10 bg-[#111315] flex items-center justify-center">

                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">

                    <button
                        onclick="previousStory()"
                        class="w-11 h-11 border border-white/10 text-white/40 hover:text-white text-lg">
                        ⏮
                    </button>


                    <button
                        onclick="nudge(-1)"
                        class="w-11 h-11 border border-white/10 text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs">
                        −
                    </button>


                    <button
                        id="playButton"
                        onclick="togglePlay()"
                        class="w-14 h-14 bg-white text-black flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold">
                        ▶
                    </button>


                    <button
                        onclick="nudge(1)"
                        class="w-11 h-11 border border-white/10 text-white/40 hover:text-white text-xs">
                        +
                    </button>


                    <button
                        onclick="nextStory()"
                        class="w-11 h-11 border border-white/10 text-white/40 hover:text-white text-lg">
                        ⏭
                    </button>

                </div>


                <div class="absolute right-6 flex items-center gap-2">

                    <button
                        onclick="resetScroll()"
                        class="h-9 px-4 border border-white/10 text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[1px] text-white/30 hover:text-white">
                        Reset
                    </button>

